# bifrost agent env — committed expectations (live values live in gitignored .env)
# The LIVE brain is the opencode-serve instance on :4096 — the same one the
# PWA proxy talks to. :4100 is the SANDBOX brain (lk-agent-ygg): pointing this
# file's OPENCODE_URL there = split brain, voice turns vanish from the chat
# (10-06 outage). agent.py compares at every boot and screams on drift.
OPENCODE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4096
# Mac Studio speech models (STT+TTS). Down = no voice on any session.
SPEACHES_URL=http://<mac-studio-lan-ip>:8001/v1   # real value: docs/local.md
# Live agent registration name — MUST differ from lab/sandbox agents on the
# shared LiveKit: on 10-06 an unclaimed lab worktree registered workers as
# 'bifrost' and LiveKit handed live re-arm dispatches to that worker (it died
# mid-room -> agent-less rooms). Live = bifrost-live; the token+dispatch
# routes read AGENT_NAME from pwa/.env.local (mirrored here).
AGENT_NAME=bifrost-live
